{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_004_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f982a85535b17f7dd7fb8a30f0158fc3d0e3b31fc98f4c74cde320808cf7e2da", "ja": "（ジュリアの初公演が無事に終わった。\n公演後、最初の仕事は、雑誌のインタビューだ）", "zh": "（茱莉亚的首场公演顺利结束了。公演结束后，第一项工作是接受杂志采访。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_004_1001_p", "source_sha256": "9ca6e22c20110b823ed71791872c5bfeb5b67e53d12bca817e5f2ef770a637d1", "ja": "（ロックバンドのボーカルから、アイドルに方向転換\nした感想などを聞かせてほしい、との事だが……）", "zh": "（据说想请你谈谈从摇滚乐队主唱转行做偶像后的感想，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_004_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "4fc31085c82b07b551a9f3fd94f469c3b2f37e2ccbab0ba480b8ad511aa5094b", "ja": "{$P$}、着替えてきたけど。\n本当に衣装、これでいいのか……？", "zh": "{$P$}，我换好衣服过来了。\n真的穿这套服装没问题吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_004_1003_p", "source_sha256": "86ecd847e3f48dafc36b7a6c530c11ad0d1a5f8a6ff4381b908a639100fd8bdb", "ja": "お疲れさま、ジュリア。雑誌のインタビューだし、\n問題ないと思うけど……衣装がどうかしたのか？", "zh": "辛苦了，茱莉亚。毕竟是杂志采访，我觉得没问题……怎么，服装有什么不对吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_004_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "7311bce7f0a3469c794a9c262cb0999bbdbeccd7eb3f609ef11f1e27f8a360ca", "ja": "いや、なんかまだ自分でも慣れないっていうか……。\nスカートなんて、普段制服くらいしか着ないからさ。", "zh": "不是，就是我自己好像还没习惯……\n毕竟平时除了校服，基本不穿裙子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_004_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "a9230ef3bb88579ea7af9a671ac70250aef47c4db0549d6b39bc9b7260d78d91", "ja": "その制服だって、\n別に好きで着てるわけじゃないしな。", "zh": "就算是那身制服，也不是因为喜欢才穿的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_004_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c72b04cd8aa5c1cc9695d2093d901e98b15877cccb52fb24e950ddbc772d13b9", "ja": "そうか。でも、もし着慣れていないだけなら、\n少しずつ慣れてもらった方がいいかもしれないな。", "zh": "这样啊。不过，如果只是还没穿习惯的话，或许还是慢慢习惯一下比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_004_1007_p", "source_sha256": "706317dcb73b34e502b8997896b2231bf3684335245d2b6e33f897bb53de0ed0", "ja": "パンツスタイルの衣装ももちろんあるけど、\nアイドルはスカートも多いから……。", "zh": "当然也有裤装，不过偶像的服装还是以裙装居多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_004_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "05af7e7a6e0883e2cec8073bf425102fe49836e3f03da3ee2a904379d72538a0", "ja": "そうだな……わかった。努力はするよ。\nなるべく早く、慣れるように……くっ。", "zh": "是啊……我明白了。我会努力的。\n尽量早点习惯起来……唔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_004_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d3e1dc258d76f53ffc083b8dcd928c4cbf6e2f2692e77f1d1bafa6bed35b8dcd", "ja": "まぁ、あんまり無理はしなくていいよ。けど制服が\n苦手って事は、もしかして学校も好きじゃないのか？", "zh": "哎，也不用太勉强自己啦。不过既然你讨厌\n制服，难道说你也不太喜欢学校吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_004_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "b495f8ae6fa7ff2740ad7079d763178a0be066fc4686b47798dc2790e8e22faa", "ja": "こっちの学校は、あたしがアイドルなのも知ってるし。\n割と自由にさせてくれるから、そうでもないかな。", "zh": "这边的学校也知道我是偶像，平时也挺自由的，所以倒也不是吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_004_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "88343a2f8e3f0fae2513447c60f4ab838edc50406ea115aca5596d433803ce23", "ja": "ただ、地元にいたころはそうだったな。\n教師と、「折り合いが悪い」……っていうのか？", "zh": "不过，我还在老家的时候确实是那样。跟老师……该说是“合不来”吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_004_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "6be4568f0890ad6f6da1af08c9a6aa6a5fe43830e4024f73675bd9455119896a", "ja": "目つきや態度が反抗的だって、\n怒鳴られてばっかだったよ。", "zh": "因为眼神和态度看起来很叛逆，我总是被他们大声训斥。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_004_1013_p", "source_sha256": "d6223d15f91dc6cd41b8ae52a729d4e6d71826dfd6f400ee94366ac2a5f2a17a", "ja": "そうか。ジュリアがロックを好きになったのは、\nその頃なのか？", "zh": "这样啊。茱莉亚就是在那时候喜欢上摇滚的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_004_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "309a6ff512b0e1f61cfe2844dccd3fd0774b4945bb59e70bf016a34e4b26623e", "ja": "それはもうすこし前。でも、\nロックにのめり込んだのは、そのころかもな。", "zh": "还要再早一些。不过，真正迷上摇滚，可能就是那个时候吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_004_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "7661eb2308bde76d8eca5d95bd39cb2b52678ed06d661c3d2771c915aa7d4ade", "ja": "学校じゃなくて、バンドが……あたしが\n一番、自分らしくいられる場所だったんだ。", "zh": "不是学校，乐队才是……\n最能让我活出自己的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_004_1016_p", "source_sha256": "e0ea69775b393fd719c9451b92322b5131d48e4b11308ce1b4084276de3e5727", "ja": "自分らしくいられる場所か……。", "zh": "能做自己的地方吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_004_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "9920ae427f745595ed61501dd1fc212e1b7bb908a79605d606cf3dcfc84277f8", "ja": "ま、中学生だったし。あたしが、なんでもかんでも\n反抗したかった時期だったってのもあるんだけど……。", "zh": "嘛，毕竟那时候还是初中生嘛。也正好是我什么都想反抗的时期……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_004_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "e22860d6a6f22dddb5b48419d5da2f88fb4816c6433a139c854fa8a1fd63d0e7", "ja": "それよりあたしが何か言ったところで、大人が\nまともに取り合ってくれないことに腹が立ったな。", "zh": "比起那个，我更生气的是，不管我说了什么，大人都不肯认真听我说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_004_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "abc9d68a1dfbdd17a96b8f1804322210ef107f0be98feb1127f8c7329c43157d", "ja": "だから……あんたみたいに、こうやって\n理由を話して説得してくれるのは、逆に安心するよ。", "zh": "所以……像你这样，愿意把理由说清楚来劝我的人，反倒让我觉得安心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_004_1020_p", "source_sha256": "98b7e3ed3432d5db0d632484b60babd3f79a0e6ed9f704205a78209306e4ca4d", "ja": "ジュリア……。", "zh": "茱莉亚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_004_1021_se", "source_sha256": "8e7f14ac05b8af6347c8336517efb85357319e29b9542e34b554f154c45397ba", "ja": "コンコン", "zh": "叩叩", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_004_1022_staff", "source_sha256": "d671bd13c56ee22d8555b6cc4fd668d060e956ab39027c71bdc4f02cf314b3d6", "ja": "失礼します！　ジュリアさん、\n準備できましたので移動お願いします！", "zh": "打扰了！茱莉亚先生，\n已经准备就绪，请动身吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_004_1023_050jul", "source_sha256": "db83db3b1435da073cb11f91c7d648cbbb9baad0071999ff1aeb830c440be9d2", "ja": "はいっ！　……なんか、\nインタビューのリハーサルみたいな話だったな？", "zh": "好！……总觉得刚才说的，像是在彩排采访一样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_004_1024_050jul", "source_sha256": "0a329e2e06f991b79b25aa0899128542ffe20567477fe8f9813592790f92e55c", "ja": "お陰で、話す内容に困らなくてすみそうだ。\n……んじゃ、行ってくる♪", "zh": "多亏了你，这下不用担心没话可说了。\n……那我走了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_004_1025_p", "source_sha256": "8d4ebf53ecd33d4575a18fffaa4192cb4b406117570ffe22b6e8853f3118dd0a", "ja": "ああ。頑張れよ、ジュリア！", "zh": "嗯。加油啊，茱莉亚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_004_1026_p", "source_sha256": "349f9a7f62fcaa8329d5643fb1a01cb18402ad00f8db093d8c3c787d3c804557", "ja": "（ロックは、ジュリアにとってのホーム……\n劇場がいつか、そういう存在になるといいんだけど）", "zh": "（摇滚对茱莉亚来说就是归宿……真希望剧场有一天也能成为这样的存在。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_004_1027_null", "source_sha256": "36855fc336aa7ad5545e91ce80256824961529d2b300412c8f7167dcaeeca334", "ja": "数カ月後……", "zh": "数个月后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_004_1028_050jul", "source_sha256": "17d72d3d6e798aa083e4d101d567a0753752c95e1c4f51d9e08bbbede422e3ba", "ja": "こらー！！　バカP！！！", "zh": "喂——！！你这个笨蛋制作人！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_004_1029_p", "source_sha256": "3edd483137a380e49b00058c7ec61566ead18fc9957f252832ff2dde601028f0", "ja": "あ、ジュリア。\nどうしたんだ、そんなに血相変えて……。", "zh": "啊，茱莉亚。\n怎么了，干吗一副慌慌张张的样子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_004_1030_050jul", "source_sha256": "f21457841e2c03a3a1d8aefd1773db5b1d10f2dc409657125d8a571fd703117b", "ja": "「どうしたんだ」じゃないだろ！？\nなんなんだよ、この新しい衣装は！", "zh": "还“怎么了”呢，搞什么啊！？\n这套新服装到底是怎么回事啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_004_1031_050jul", "source_sha256": "3269a56fad0692c793fa4c03e5dbe66c31ad2df0d62e031672995bd803f35429", "ja": "ていうか、パンツスタイルもあるって言ったのに、\nなんでまたスカートなんだよ！？", "zh": "话说回来，我明明说过也有裤装的吧，\n为什么又是裙子啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_004_1032_p", "source_sha256": "8f760cf01141c462d0ab3f989eeded810533cb50c185a186a3df34edd34accc6", "ja": "でもこの前、慣れるために\n努力するって言ってなかったか？", "zh": "可是你之前不是还说过，要努力去适应吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_004_1033_050jul", "source_sha256": "efe225b282666d5f2231e683af54d7049008e148dc43433528a7fb8aaa70131b", "ja": "だ、だからって、なんでも着るなんて\n言ったわけじゃない！　限度があるってんだ！", "zh": "但、但也不是说什么都要穿啊！总得有个限度吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_004_1034_050jul", "source_sha256": "6a26d89fe5a58b7152487eec39c226ffa8ed1dddb0f1098ff2c2d3b26c34f4b9", "ja": "この衣装、前のヤツより、ヒラヒラしたのが\n増えてるじゃないか……こ、こんなカワイイ……。", "zh": "这套服装比之前那套多了好多飘飘的装饰……这、这么可爱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_004_1035_p", "source_sha256": "dd02ca67b7366440b6706c36cc88e9ee6805544fad6a605aaff88f38fe6fdf0d", "ja": "いいじゃないか、よく似合ってるよ。\n頑張って、少しずつ慣れていこうな！", "zh": "挺好的嘛，非常适合你哦。\n加油，慢慢习惯就好啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_004_1036_050jul", "source_sha256": "b4ac272aae41c967b481a12c50aefe05dc743ba27090b75c85f02cf055b9d562", "ja": "くぅ……バカP！　覚えてろよ！", "zh": "呜……笨蛋制作人！你给我记住了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
